  "title": {
   "en": "I Saw a Play"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "나는 한 편의 극을 보았다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a moment between reality and illusion, the protagonist awakens to find herself in a new body, where memories intertwine and the lines between who she was and who she has become begin to blur. This isn’t just a new beginning—it’s a complex mystery that ties past, present, and future together. Is she merely a witness to someone else’s fate, or has destiny granted her a second chance to uncover the truth?"
  },
